eplo-:R36rj2:"><div data-rid="e2b02664-dc80-489e-93af-651714c803fc" class="r-17hb0qk"><div data-rid="dc328465-568c-4e0c-93d9-93b6a616160a" class="r-1uf210c alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Orders usually leave our warehouse within 1–2 business days. Standard U.S. shipping takes 3–5 business days, and we offer expedited options at checkout if you need it sooner.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d8efa1e2-99c3-41d1-9c80-ade88718e5eb" class="r-36lnvd" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="43024e60-6505-45b5-8aa4-507807b8d8c7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R56rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6vdpjs"><div data-rid="c63cbb10-de1b-4b68-90ad-277700af9d20" class="r-1oqtocg alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do you ship internationally?</p></span></div><div data-rid="fa0ecb05-c0d1-4777-89f3-16e9ee7e568d" class="r-igib9q" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R56rj2:"><div data-rid="b6cc3beb-40da-4be0-9882-41b1ce90d624" class="r-1xfwd8o"><div data-rid="f0807634-1770-490a-b57a-ebf8636d96a1" class="r-ye38xi alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! We ship worldwide. International delivery times vary depending on the destination, but most orders arrive within 7–14 business days.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5fc49dfa-8572-40e6-b083-4ff52e5671b6" class="r-8j0x2c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4e0e3941-ed61-4644-8be3-4cd6de9b3c27" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R76rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-7zbz9z"><div data-rid="29b379c0-f06c-4e91-949f-1e3e4d73e516" class="r-diyf0v alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's your return policy?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a2b059bb-35db-45b5-80f7-fb1769b038a9" class="r-emor9i" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R76rj2:"><div data-rid="356e3665-1be3-4491-a878-3c7052c7fc13" class="r-1i8uthd"><div data-rid="677d6018-2665-4a88-86d7-2b0214409733" class="r-a2nu9v alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>If you don't love your Monti cooler, return it within 30 days for a 50% refund — no hassle, no hard feelings.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0880272f-0050-4046-8791-ba678b66929f" class="r-1otr9vn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="eee94824-bb43-40b0-b9aa-7e79db70cdcc" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R96rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1rp2ogs"><div data-rid="cc3cbc36-e2ea-4d1d-a3dc-3130d260d1ae" class="r-1pay4jw alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What if my cooler arrives damaged or defective?</p></span></div><div data-rid="530c9294-a8ff-442b-bbe2-69dcb695fc2c" class="r-1si81tk" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R96rj2:"><div data-rid="fe4b14ec-c2d8-4308-a73a-a2784de055d1" class="r-1cxjife"><div data-rid="c75428d7-6de8-4b76-a829-f37cd7e0122d" class="r-15fekb8 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Reach out to our support team and we'll replace it right away. Every Monti product is covered against defects.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbj2:-trigger-f2a8a515-ae2e-493a-887c-3949047bead31" id="radix-:Rbj2:-content-f2a8a515-ae2e-493a-887c-3949047bead31" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="5c58c3d7-74cb-4457-8363-dada4edafdae" class="r-1ak8o2s"><div data-rid="f82f73ee-c45b-49c9-b45b-1753ffaf3efd" class="r-1s9yagb" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f9ae8797-8e12-43c9-be3a-1279e9491c69" class="r-1bxiwpj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0f883e76-3073-423a-b7c9-39bef30b71f1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3arj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1m0lzzm"><div data-rid="29280b79-efec-4a80-ad6b-cd3df642e1ee" class="r-z7e5ne alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long does Monti keep drinks cold?</p></span></div><div data-rid="de8aff43-5b77-4dbf-a1ea-ded9f89406a0" class="r-4j1g89" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3arj2:"><div data-rid="2692b908-ec69-4cb4-a5da-f9c2a22876a4" class="r-5cgj6e"><div data-rid="2d264261-e6ab-4197-882d-7b44fddfaa8c" class="r-lafqe9 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Independent testing by Outdoor Life found Monti coolers held ice for up to 55 hours — on par with heavy-duty hard coolers, but at a fraction of the weight.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ba225d01-6f6c-406e-ad6c-197bfa73bff8" class="r-pn7hza" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8419261b-e743-4c5e-82d9-a289a9b380af" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5arj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1t2rp9j"><div data-rid="4b6cfa40-f200-4908-91a8-dadfe44d64ed" class="r-1ubzds4 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it really leakproof?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9500c53d-2784-46bc-906c-061c57a23d76" class="r-81bmgr" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5arj2:"><div data-rid="aecd468d-a062-406e-9c37-5fa9b013e003" class="r-18slmw7"><div data-rid="a58a338e-8da4-4596-9f99-2cf2ea7b7b2f" class="r-voo6e8 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Each cooler uses a seam-welded liner that prevents leaks — even when tipped on its side.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="68a333a0-297a-4aa8-865b-89157ac66b7a" class="r-1j0tx1p" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="262082f0-5e86-45c6-9db9-70d3eae45b76" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7arj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-sbhd2y"><div data-rid="ae4479f5-1637-46ee-b19c-1e352546e2c4" class="r-1jfew1u alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the material?</p></span></div><div data-rid="23188e92-0be9-4593-82ce-82fd12b687cc" class="r-1731ncy" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7arj2:"><div data-rid="4cc49a75-c0a7-4e4c-8072-2689e4e179d5" class="r-1k3kg0k"><div data-rid="bd5671c1-1ae7-4baf-acf5-a3430d40cf22" class="r-agqgyt alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The shell is made of quilted, PFAS-free nylon with reinforced stitching. It's soft, durable, and stylish enough to take anywhere.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="21020a67-a298-4c2e-88f6-35eb4fc4ae15" class="r-f7h963" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1872c334-153e-428b-84e3-296dd904121a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9arj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6nizym"><div data-rid="86353a78-b747-46a5-9248-5951d2e24580" class="r-11qly0v alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Will condensation be a problem?</p></span></div><div data-rid="02e80705-cf5e-47a3-a2f6-428a44dbdc51" class="r-h8leif" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9arj2:"><div data-rid="6e492f69-decc-4575-b7b9-d16e8b7cd05e" class="r-f02wbq"><div data-rid="dd197be5-8ab1-4652-bddd-6ce8d922a342" class="r-u1p5b0 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>In humid environments, we recommend ice packs instead of loose ice for best results. That way you get long chill time without excess moisture.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbj2:-trigger-c6cd748d-78ca-4e23-92c4-29d9946d3b7c2" id="radix-:Rbj2:-content-c6cd748d-78ca-4e23-92c4-29d9946d3b7c2" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="c6b983dc-95ba-43e0-aa4c-e703803db953" class="r-1fl3yeg"><div data-rid="5162a352-e63e-460f-bc50-aeec1c36665b" class="r-5skedz" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2ec94ef8-1278-4cff-8aae-1a63b93e146e" class="r-jh0pdb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="78239f42-fe36-41c9-a435-544856606c57" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3erj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-gl5piy"><div data-rid="7b35a6c6-7a29-4f20-9a17-ebef16c0e363" class="r-vp39sc alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it TSA or carry-on approved?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9c26855c-aa50-433b-9e5d-73230f7c59c8" class="r-18t2ak4" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3erj2:"><div data-rid="16b2af9c-d3b8-4383-b0f3-7cad9cede48b" class="r-1jhtowr"><div data-rid="15eaa8bd-f4b4-4793-a897-e48218fc2b3f" class="r-19dc4io alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes — all Monti coolers fold into their built-in stuff sack and fit easily in carry-ons, backpacks, or totes. No oversized baggage fees here.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ef685186-aeed-4159-a486-3f7aca8d4b55" class="r-nnokzf" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="395499d1-734f-47df-8808-8a2bf97f28e6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5erj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1o5g0ru"><div data-rid="fe979c60-52d3-4b3f-990a-12302c5605b8" class="r-p3y674 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How small does it pack down?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a80b624f-f57e-4fc4-8323-b51e0d4a0e57" class="r-6nlril" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5erj2:"><div data-rid="9e10508d-06e6-4ab9-ab2b-e02ff0731a72" class="r-1x6q4tf"><div data-rid="0d226183-7e3f-4669-987f-ab4419806e1b" class="r-im01ta alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Shasta compresses into a 9" x 9" x 3.5" sack — smaller than a hoodie. The Mayfly packs down even smaller.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5d6bf0f0-2359-4971-aba6-0a9960debb0b" class="r-up2qwk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="930fc8eb-326f-427a-b30c-425ed2efc5ee" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7erj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-gz5bts"><div data-rid="151607a0-4009-46a8-a02c-b125735be423" class="r-13g5e9y alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I fit it under an airplane seat?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d520bdc9-c9f7-4ba7-8a0c-b8f6bef8089c" class="r-z8mahl" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7erj2:"><div data-rid="740b0bfe-f7fe-4309-951f-78b2033e6b9b" class="r-1bna6g8"><div data-rid="eddb9f68-2539-41e9-920c-93e338fa6c34" class="r-u8on12 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Customers regularly bring Monti coolers on flights — they fit under seats and in overhead bins when packed flat.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8ab29081-bc60-4f87-9ecf-9607616e9e9c" class="r-1xvlab2" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a2d7e01d-c995-416d-b692-1da94fd40d4b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9erj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-12nmh36"><div data-rid="26c454b6-f9f4-4e00-9021-f7938956fc4c" class="r-1kv7duo alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does it add much weight to my luggage?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d3e7b0c9-9f8a-468e-8db2-2e8b984a7ae7" class="r-1xgrga2" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9erj2:"><div data-rid="b21861dd-1657-49ec-a8d2-ba57c8fc8f89" class="r-1jeo7p8"><div data-rid="7250bde0-0088-40f4-b506-2133d724b9fe" class="r-ec04za alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Not at all. The Shasta weighs only 17 oz (about as much as a water bottle).</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbj2:-trigger-d304924e-46a7-4470-8ea3-9952e6f7c50b3" id="radix-:Rbj2:-content-d304924e-46a7-4470-8ea3-9952e6f7c50b3" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="aafa6c45-809e-47fa-ad56-e8e93183d250" class="r-1wpy2g6"><div data-rid="71e1f567-47a9-4bcb-9ce1-8b429a9abaf4" class="r-1c57uoy" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6bdd1336-9f4d-49fa-8988-c37843a49972" class="r-1loz84g" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="888df8b0-acdd-41a4-8126-7eff094a93bc" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3irj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-966hib"><div data-rid="81c087d0-82f2-4d7b-b3b1-560c06ccb53d" class="r-i3dbpa alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is this good for hiking or camping?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f61a9503-3aef-48ef-b6b2-a276733c24e3" class="r-yto4yg" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3irj2:"><div data-rid="d442781e-47c5-4be0-9fbf-c149646fc532" class="r-1blsoj2"><div data-rid="33e64ccd-1a6d-4e08-84cf-e14b1306ed5a" class="r-1udhjrs alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely. Lightweight design and backpack straps make it perfect for trails, day hikes, or car camping trips.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2f952884-5243-4729-bea3-d4c820e44377" class="r-1795nip" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1c475614-9382-4142-a04e-7f84785f6742" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5irj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1awlhcc"><div data-rid="a96041f9-8e66-43ce-973a-7726576b3b1a" class="r-1hnwrzf alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take it on a boat or to the beach?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2f4565ac-eaa9-490c-a29e-c349d7abaac5" class="r-1gr3mw9" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5irj2:"><div data-rid="9152ce3c-bba1-4e12-a507-20512aae80e2" class="r-vaxp5"><div data-rid="47d12d52-d6f2-4988-b90c-afc51756eb5d" class="r-1dcmo4s alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Monti coolers are leak-resistant, sand-friendly, and easy to rinse clean after saltwater use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d67846ec-181b-47ea-8e67-bf2680e0e8dc" class="r-3lbvr9" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="91736052-c03a-4935-a52e-58913ff312a1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7irj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1f62l2v"><div data-rid="942e5bf0-6b6b-4832-a737-e53309e954a9" class="r-1l3mb5u alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it useful for parents?</p></span></div><div data-rid="77a8cb1b-a430-4d69-8323-bdbdd14db6da" class="r-7klj4n" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7irj2:"><div data-rid="443ed402-c273-4ad5-b764-adbadc5f9c3c" class="r-5td4zy"><div data-rid="caa29dbf-8dd6-44d2-8439-d77ba63a5e57" class="r-fi0ezc alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many parents use Monti coolers for park days, sports practice, or road trips — it keeps snacks and drinks cold without the bulk of a hard cooler.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9c3ea062-b0f7-42fb-9a8c-9e2868292f21" class="r-1xm946d" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="de17a81d-d8a7-43da-9062-094dd6226baf" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9irj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-37gi3u"><div data-rid="a4e7a08a-89d6-4a72-829e-8b72189ff673" class="r-1c6xo23 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use it for tailgate or college events?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5d68da54-bf55-4359-890a-e77c94802ed8" class="r-xwanp4" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9irj2:"><div data-rid="fba17675-3692-40ba-81db-0677f2a42bd2" class="r-1yohqv0"><div data-rid="72404d96-cc56-43cf-a9da-7efa2a23ff57" class="r-8wzmyl alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! The Shasta holds up to 23 cans and keeps them cold all game day.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6609dff7-a94e-46d6-af13-cb2c29cab668" class="r-1alq4qq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="430afdc4-5d90-413d-9c57-74e57cc32ee2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbirj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-hlb8k6"><div data-rid="f91ebd25-5180-4dba-901d-fe96c24aecb7" class="r-tjgzfr alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does it works for everyday errands?</p></span></div><div data-rid="35e30807-9767-4cd9-b693-00e1e0fe5545" class="r-1e4bgkb" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbirj2:"><div data-rid="6b5103c8-97b2-4769-b3c9-ad1bcf868b7a" class="r-19h25y4"><div data-rid="d87ba6a4-acd4-4ea0-9619-b92b9c4e0dd0" class="r-1g3plwm alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Definitely. Monti coolers double as grocery bags, lunch totes, or even as an insulated carrier for wine or flowers.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbj2:-trigger-afca4b76-bb0b-43ba-a6d7-08be798b83c84" id="radix-:Rbj2:-content-afca4b76-bb0b-43ba-a6d7-08be798b83c84" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="31852441-a139-4b7f-8b35-94ccc3764024" class="r-1v2vql2"><div data-rid="709f3928-623e-49ac-939e-965afdc8b22c" class="r-mp2g01" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3afe064c-67aa-4edc-9d56-7434a0b47ff6" class="r-162ri2b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="043974cc-16e3-4739-8380-aee65b75ab8f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3mrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1d9qar4"><div data-rid="ec7ffea0-a611-4e23-a4d0-caa004ec8d7d" class="r-14qdgkw alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the difference between Shasta and Mayfly?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6b8ac9cc-c871-4ba1-9c03-74121bf309e3" class="r-jkw588" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3mrj2:"><div data-rid="dd7e9ec5-e06e-4d2f-8868-16c4428c1d30" class="r-10ra4i1"><div data-rid="d304e2fc-d2d3-47bc-a87d-0f847ce9aa80" class="r-1158qn5 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Shasta (23L) is our largest cooler — it holds up to 23 cans or 5 bottles of wine, perfect for group trips. The Mayfly (14L) is smaller and lighter, ideal for day trips or solo adventures.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="46787cc0-2cfc-496d-93d6-4ffab7bdb90f" class="r-127b9r8" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9034de35-2b82-4024-b818-46086b7e1723" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5mrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-pkzobn"><div data-rid="1031753a-85f0-4e10-8290-470625cccfa2" class="r-1upikej alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What about the Adventure Diaper Bag?</p></span></div><div data-rid="cfb85b14-3233-4b25-b7fa-7f3df0bb460c" class="r-1mu1txa" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5mrj2:"><div data-rid="8a8a931c-5b27-45f9-babc-96da9e5c5590" class="r-1bidk4h"><div data-rid="975b5366-7613-48aa-b01b-f7ba084e14f2" class="r-jrk3xg alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Adventure Bag is designed for parents on the go. It includes an insulated bottle pouch, smart storage, and stroller hooks — combining Monti's cooling tech with parenting convenience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="93803bd2-8ca9-4282-95a7-ae986577805c" class="r-168mjxq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d64fc573-429a-44d0-90f0-c2b90ab63a90" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7mrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1hmrsw9"><div data-rid="4912bc3e-bff5-44de-abda-cbd38366fa22" class="r-he09z2 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How much does each cooler weigh?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5b3a1bdd-1a63-4538-97dd-54d57317b53b" class="r-1xh25rz" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7mrj2:"><div data-rid="9224974b-142c-45c9-a9a4-93d65c2af354" class="r-uw3dik"><div data-rid="282d91c0-955a-476f-bc75-eabfb46a2847" class="r-8zytor alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Shasta: 17.2 oz. Mayfly: 14.7 oz. Both are lighter than most water bottles.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="72eeae71-e2e6-44ad-99d7-7a618b6ba52e" class="r-msjw97" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e85cefc5-e3e3-4891-9326-b928df3610fd" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9mrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-4qibcr"><div data-rid="01ec0414-acd0-47fe-b58c-1a5955d45d1b" class="r-2uvfj7 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I pick the right size?</p></span></div><div data-rid="adbf9ebc-42b0-453c-833b-f5ffe4e97cdc" class="r-xuqpwd" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9mrj2:"><div data-rid="28ea9fe4-9809-41c0-9e8d-48e0e8de5b01" class="r-12bpt2"><div data-rid="5d9e0706-3ac6-44c0-9820-d4cccddf8295" class="r-zpw9e0 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>If you're traveling with family or groups, go with the Shasta. For solo adventures or carry-on minimalism, the Mayfly is perfect. Parents who want versatility should check out the Adventure Bag.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b89e4241-1633-4814-a92d-88e7236a323a" class="r-1crjw19" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="862a2b37-e98b-42be-853b-abb135e49a52" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbmrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1gxlpkl"><div data-rid="6e7ae4ff-2bea-44c9-8fe2-e1ba2248334f" class="r-7la3m2 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I own more than one?</p></span></div><div data-rid="866a80ce-f1ad-4c9c-a5d1-a945568943ac" class="r-50xzlm" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbmrj2:"><div data-rid="29bcb360-0852-4ad1-940f-7971b25bc42c" class="r-1t4lwus"><div data-rid="dacb00ff-9794-4b48-b16f-6673de21ff1e" class="r-ofdb52 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many customers do! Shasta for bigger trips, Mayfly for everyday runs, Adventure Bag for family needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4a76f38d-f903-4b06-80fd-46c6b25413e7" class="r-whv6aj" data-alchemy-prerendered-component-id="4a76f38d-f903-4b06-80fd-46c6b25413e7">{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-alchemy-prerendered-placeholder="true"></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ovo:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Work+Sans:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Mulish:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
